"description":"The Doximity Clinical AI Suite helps clinicians get answers, communicate with patients, and complete documentation—all in one workflow.\n\nAsk delivers fast, cited answers. Dialer connects you with patients by voice, video, and text. Scribe automatically generates clinical notes from patient visits.\n\nDoximity is the largest network of U.S. clinicians and the AI-powered platform trusted by over 85% of U.S. physicians.\n\nFree, HIPAA-compliant, and built for clinicians.\n\n\"This should be on every physician's phone.\" – App Review\n\nFeatures\n- Get fast, cited answers grounded in medical literature\n- Generate clinical notes automatically with AI\n- Call, video, and securely message patients\n- Send and receive HIPAA-compliant faxes\n- Prescribe medications directly from your phone\n- Stay current with personalized medical news\n- Connect with the largest network of U.S. clinicians\n- Integrate with Epic Haiku and Amion\n\nTestimonials\n\"Doximity Ask is a fantastic resource I use every single day when researching complex conditions. The evidence-based responses make it a breeze to increase my understanding of difficult topics in a fraction of the time it used to take.\" – Dr. Tyler Agnew, MD\n\n\"With Doximity Ask, I input all the active diagnoses the patient had, what my goal was, and within 15 seconds my letter of clinical necessity was written, describing all the relevant conditions perfectly, speaking to their severity and truly making a good case for the need for resources.\" – Dr. Shubho Sarkar, MD\n\n\"Really great app for calling my patients. Can set the number that shows up on caller ID as my office. Also has the option to send a message straight to their voicemail or send text messages without giving out my personal cell number.\" – App Review\n\n\"I have used Doximity Scribe now for almost 2 years and it has been amazing!! It allows me to concentrate more on my patient. Saves me so much time!\" – Dr. Zarin Nestor, MD\n\n\"So nice to have a secure fax for medical records and labs. I love getting results on the go and being able to respond in real time to information.\" – App Review\n\n\"Concise articles. Quick to read and relevant. Haven’t noticed any editorializing, which I greatly appreciate. Just the facts, ma’am.\" – App Review", "bundleId":"com.doximity.directoryV10", "languageCodesISO2A":["EN"], "fileSizeBytes":"364877824", "formattedPrice":"Free", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":200294, "trackContentRating":"17+", "sellerUrl":"https://www.doximity.com", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.8249399999999997845634425175376236438751220703125, "userRatingCount":200294}, 
